            <ArticleTitle>Effectiveness of stents in small coronary arteries.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>584-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This study was prospectively randomized to assess the efficacy and safety of Jo heparin-coated stent deployment in small vessels compared with balloon angioplasty. In 202 patients, restenosis in balloon and stent arms was 49% and 30%, respectively.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
